{"root":"garis","ipa":"/ˈɡa.ris/","core":"指平面或空间中的线、线条、条纹，也可以引申为界限、路线、方针等。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈɡa.ris/","zh":"线，线条，条纹","phrases":[{"t":"garis lurus","zh":"直线"},{"t":"garis pantai","zh":"海岸线"},{"t":"garis besar","zh":"大纲，要点"}],"examples":[{"t":"Gambarkan sebuah garis lurus di atas kertas.","zh":"在纸上画一条直线。"},{"t":"Hotel ini terletak di dekat garis pantai.","zh":"这家酒店位于海岸线附近。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"garis","ipa":"/ˈɡa.ris/","zh":"线，条纹","phrase":{"t":"garis merah","zh":"红线，关键界限"},"example":{"t":"Mereka menarik garis di atas pasir.","zh":"他们在沙地上划了一条线。"}},{"w":"menggaris","ipa":"/məŋˈɡa.ris/","zh":"画线，划线","phrase":{"t":"menggaris kertas","zh":"在纸上画线"},"example":{"t":"Guru sedang menggaris papan tulis.","zh":"老师正在黑板上画线。"}},{"w":"menggarisi","ipa":"/məŋ.ɡaˈri.si/","zh":"给...画线，划界","phrase":{"t":"menggarisi kalimat","zh":"给句子划线"},"example":{"t":"Tolong menggarisi kata-kata penting ini.","zh":"请把这些重要的词汇划线标记出来。"}},{"w":"menggarisbawahi","ipa":"/məŋ.ɡa.ris.baˈwa.hi/","zh":"在...下划线，强调","phrase":{"t":"menggarisbawahi pentingnya","zh":"强调...的重要性"},"example":{"t":"Direktur menggarisbawahi perlunya disiplin kerja.","zh":"经理强调了工作纪律的必要性。"}},{"w":"garisan","ipa":"/ɡaˈri.san/","zh":"直尺，划痕","phrase":{"t":"garisan plastik","zh":"塑料直尺"},"example":{"t":"Gunakan garisan untuk membuat gambar yang rapi.","zh":"用直尺来画出整齐的图画。"}},{"w":"tergaris","ipa":"/tərˈɡa.ris/","zh":"已画线的，被划出的","phrase":{"t":"sudah tergaris","zh":"已经划好线的"},"example":{"t":"Buku tulis itu sudah tergaris dengan rapi.","zh":"那个笔记本已经整齐地划好了线。"}}],"derSlugs":["garis","menggaris","menggarisi","menggarisbawahi","garisan","tergaris"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T02:22:39.957Z","src":"base"}